{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-73519:  ruby:2.5 security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "ruby\n[2.5.9-114]\n- Fix integer overflow in search_in_range function in regexec.c (CVE-2019-19012).\n  Resolves: RHEL-87505\n\n[2.5.9-113]\n- Fix REXML ReDoS vulnerability. (CVE-2024-49761)\n  Resolves: RHEL-68515\n\n[2.5.9-112]\n- Fix ReDoS vulnerability - upstream's incomplete fix for CVE-2023-28755.\n  (CVE-2023-36617)\n  Resolves: RHEL-5614\n- Fix Buffer overread vulnerability in StringIO.\n  (CVE-2024-27280)\n  Resolves: RHEL-34125\n- Fix RCE vulnerability with .rdoc_options in RDoc.\n  (CVE-2024-27281)\n  Resolves: RHEL-34117\n- Fix Arbitrary memory address read vulnerability with Regex search.\n  (CVE-2024-27282)\n  Resolves: RHEL-33867\n- Fix REXML DoS parsing an XML with many \u0026lt;s in an attribute value.\n  (CVE-2024-35176)\n  Resolves: RHEL-37877\n\n[2.5.9-111]\n- Fix HTTP response splitting in CGI.\n  Resolves: CVE-2021-33621\n- Fix Buffer overrun in String-to-Float conversion.\n  Resolves: CVE-2022-28739\n- Fix ReDoS vulnerability in URI.\n  Resolves: CVE-2023-28755\n- Fix ReDoS vulnerability in Time.\n  Resolves: CVE-2023-28756\n\n[2.5.9-111]\n- Fix rdoc parsing of nil text tokens.\n  Resolves: rhbz#2210326\n\n[2.5.9-110]\n- Fix FTBFS due to an incompatible load directive.\n- Fix a fiddle import test on an optimized glibc on Power 9.\n- Fix by adding length limit option for methods that parses date strings.\n  Resolves: CVE-2021-41817\n- CGI::Cookie.parse no longer decodes cookie names to prevent spoofing security\n  prefixes in cookie names.\n  Resolves: CVE-2021-41819\n\n[2.5.9-109]\n- Properly fix command injection vulnerability in Rdoc.\n  Related: CVE-2021-31799\n\n[2.5.9-108]\n- Fix command injection vulnerability in RDoc.\n  Resolves: CVE-2021-31799\n- Fix StartTLS stripping vulnerability in Net::IMAP\n  Resolves: CVE-2021-32066\n- Fix FTP PASV command response can cause Net::FTP to connect to arbitrary host.\n  Resolves: CVE-2021-31810\n\n[2.5.9-107]\n- Update to Ruby 2.5.9.\n  * Remove Patch20: ruby-2.6.0-rdoc-6.0.1-fix-template-typo.patch; subsumed\n  Resolves: rhbz#1757844\n- Resolv::DNS: timeouts if multiple IPv6 name servers are given and address\n  contains leading zero\n  Resolves: rhbz#1950308\n\n[2.5.5-106]\n- Remove file with non-commercial license from did_you_mean gem.\n  Resolves: rhbz#1846113\n\nrubygem-abrt\n[0.3.0-4]\n- Execute test suite unconditionally.\n- Upload correct sources.\n\n[0.3.0-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_28_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.3.0-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_27_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.3.0-1]\n- Update to abrt 0.3.0.\n\n[0.2.0-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_26_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.2.0-1]\n- Update to abrt 0.2.0.\n\n[0.1.1-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_24_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.1.1-1]\n- Update to abrt 0.1.1.\n\n[0.0.6-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_23_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.0.6-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_21_Mass_Rebuild\n\nrubygem-bson\n[4.3.0-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_28_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[4.3.0-1]\n- Update to bson 4.3.0.\n- Remove Obsoletes (rhbz#1537219)\n\n[4.2.2-3]\n- Rebuilt for switch to libxcrypt\n\n[4.2.2-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Ruby_2.5\n\n[4.2.2-1]\n- Update to bson 4.2.2.\n\n[4.2.1-5]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_27_Binutils_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[4.2.1-4]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_27_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[4.2.1-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_26_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[4.2.1-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Ruby_2.4\n\n[4.2.1-1]\n- Update to bson 4.2.1.\n\nrubygem-bundler\n[1.16.1-5]\n- Fix unexpected code execution in Gemfiles (CVE-2021-43809)\n  Resolves: RHEL-87017\n\n[1.16.1-4]\n- Fix Bundler dependency confusion.\n  Resolves: CVE-2020-36327\n\n[1.16.1-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_28_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[1.16.1-2]\n- Remove unnecessary executable bit.\n\n[1.16.1-1]\n- Update to Bundler 1.16.1.\n\n[1.16.0-1]\n- Update to Bundler 1.16.0.\n\n[1.13.7-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_27_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[1.13.7-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_26_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[1.13.7-1]\n- Update to Bundler 1.13.7.\n\n[1.13.6-1]\n- Update to Bundler 1.13.6.\n\nrubygem-mongo\n[2.5.1-3]\n- Fix Data disclosure and denial of service via query-operator injection.\n  (CVE-2026-88030)\n  Resolves: RHEL-259675\n\n[2.5.1-2]\n- Disable tests to fix FTBFS by dropped MongoDB module.\n  Resolves: rhbz#1710863\n\n[2.5.1-1]\n- Update to mongo 2.5.1.\n\n[2.5.0-1]\n- Update to mongo 2.5.0.\n\n[2.4.3-2]\n- Escape macros in %changelog\n\n[2.4.3-1]\n- Update to mongo 2.4.3.\n\n[2.4.1-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_27_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[2.4.1-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_26_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[2.4.1-1]\n- Update to mongo 2.4.1.\n\n[2.4.0-1]\n- Update to mongo 2.4.0.\n\nrubygem-mysql2\n[0.4.10-4]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_28_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.4.10-3]\n- Rebuilt for switch to libxcrypt\n\n[0.4.10-2]\n- F-28: rebuild for ruby25\n\n[0.4.10-1]\n- New upstream release 0.4.10\n\n[0.4.8-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_27_Binutils_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.4.8-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_27_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.4.8-1]\n- New upstream release 0.4.8 (builds against MariaDB 10.2)\n\n[0.4.4-3]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_26_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.4.4-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Ruby_2.4\n\n[0.4.4-1]\n- New upstream release 0.4.4\n\nrubygem-pg\n[1.0.0-3]\n- Fix FTBFS with PostgreSQL 10.6 and above.\n\n[1.0.0-2]\n- Assign a random testing port.\n\n[1.0.0-1]\n- Update to pg 1.0.0.\n\n[0.21.0-5]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_28_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[0.21.0-4]\n- Rebuilt for switch to libxcrypt\n\n[0.21.0-3]\n- Rebuilt for